  "document": "KKBN\nKKBN (93.5 FM) The Cabin a radio station since 1986 broadcasting a Country music format since March 2000. Licensed to Twain Harte, California, United States, the station serves the greater Mother Lode area comprising Tuolumne and Calaveras Counties with a combined population of approximately 110,000. The station is currently owned by Clarke Broadcasting Corporation."
